# ==============================================================================
# Unnamed-Game-Notes — Obsidian vault
#
# NOTE ON IMAGES / ASSETS:
# Image, audio, and video files are intentionally NOT ignored. This vault is a
# design document, and visual references (mockups, mood boards, concept art,
# screenshots) are part of the content. Commit them.
# If a single file exceeds ~50 MB, GitHub will warn; ~100 MB is a hard reject.
# Use Git LFS for anything that large rather than adding it here.
# ==============================================================================


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Obsidian
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Shared config (appearance, core-plugins, graph, hotkeys) IS tracked so the
# whole team gets the same vault setup. Only per-machine churn is ignored below.

# Pane layout + open-file state. Rewritten constantly; conflicts on every pull.
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json

# Local caches and indexes
.obsidian/cache
.obsidian/*.cache
.obsidian/plugins/*/data.json.bak

# Community plugin settings often store API keys / tokens. This repo is PUBLIC,
# so plugin data is ignored by default. Force-add a specific one if it is safe:
#   git add -f .obsidian/plugins/<plugin-name>/data.json
.obsidian/plugins/*/data.json

# Obsidian's own soft-delete folder — deleted notes land here
.trash/
.obsidian/trash/

# Sync / publish state
.obsidian/sync.json
.obsidian/publish.json


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Claude Code / AI assistants
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CLAUDE.md IS tracked on purpose — it is shared project context for the team.

.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.json
.claude/local/
.claude/todos/
.claude/shell-snapshots/
.claude/statsig/
.claude/history.jsonl

# Other assistants
.cursor/
.cursorignore
.cursorrules.local
.aider*
.windsurf/
.continue/
.codeium/
.github/copilot-instructions.local.md


