# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Game-engine build output
#
# DELIBERATELY COMMENTED OUT. This is a notes vault, not an engine project.
# Engine ignore patterns like Builds/, Logs/, Saved/, Temp/ and Binaries/ would
# silently swallow note folders with those very reasonable names -- "Builds" is
# an obvious folder for character-build notes.
#
# If an actual engine project ever gets nested in here, do NOT uncomment these
# at the vault root. Put a scoped .gitignore inside that project folder instead,
# or prefix each rule with the project path (e.g. /Prototype/Library/).
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Unity
# [Ll]ibrary/
# [Tt]emp/
# [Oo]bj/
# [Bb]uild[s]/
# [Ll]ogs/
# [Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
# *.csproj
# *.unityproj
# *.sln

# Godot
# .godot/
# .import/
# export_presets.cfg

# Unreal
# Binaries/
# DerivedDataCache/
# Intermediate/
# Saved/
